"P778782468" "I have special mission for you. There are people stalking me and they may be related to those Spetsnaz you ran into earlier. But Krylov is too smart for stupid spies. Ha! I turn around and follow them to warehouse!  There they are meeting with strange men for unknown purpose.  I do not like these things happening. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go there and defeat the spies before they - how you say - spill any beans about me!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2503731327" "Take down the spies and witnesses"
// SendOffString :
"P3297642750" "These spies can bring big problem to me. Take them out!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2655593778" "What you waiting for? Take out the spies!"

