// Dialog :
"P1048228503" "One of them mentioned Kaminsky? This bad news, comrade. Kaminsky is - how you say - skeleton in closet for me. He is part of Spetsnaz force I used to work for back in old Soviet Union. I created special soldiers for Spetsnaz for long time. Now I think they want me back. Is very bad news, both for you and me. They think you are one of my creations! They won't stop until they capture BOTH of us! You feel like working for Spetsnaz? Bad wages, no benefits, comrade. Oh, and they kill you if you - how you say - mess up!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3540401188" "The Spetsnaz were hunting {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P816910953" "Do not worry about Spetsnaz hunting us, for Krylov have plan! The Spetsnaz are looking for other metahumans I create to get to me. That is why they hunt you now as well. But I know good target for them! One of my experiments went a bit - how you say - off his nut and decided to become a hero. Big embarassment for Krylov let me tell you! If we set him up for the Spetsnaz, we can draw out their leader and take him out. No more Spetsnaz leader, no more problems for you and Krylov, da? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to King's Row and take out the hero Electroshock!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P482773723" "Defeat Electroshock and witnesses"
// SendOffString :
"P3912646945" "I have boat ready at docks. When you get to Paragon City, head to King's Row to find Electroshock. He is known to do is hero act around there."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4213794599" "Why are you still here talking with Krylov? Hunt down Electroshock!"

