// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3388697312" "The rogue Spetsnaz group that were after Krylov have been defeated, thanks to your efficient pounding of faces! But Roman Turovsky is the one who told them that information! Even after Krylov gave Turovsky big discount on super-soldiers back in Soviet Union! This is matter of revenge for Krylov now!<br><br>That big rat Turovsky has come to Rogue Islands to try to be friends with Arachnos. He is on his way to speak with Arachnos right now.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take down Turovsky before he meets with Arachnos.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2519189204" "Take down Turovsky and witnesses"
// SendOffString :
"P2206415141" "Turovsky is a traitorous dog. Break him."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1367682995" "Krylov is not pleased by your lack of hurry. Go now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3587723130" "Arachnos operatives patrol the area. Unfortunately for them, no witnesses can be left."

